      "description": "Wise Words for Moms is now an App!\n“She speaks with wisdom, and faithful instruction is on her tongue.” Prov 31:26\nThe wisdom of Wise Words for Moms is now available no matter where you are. Store it on your iPhone or iPad for quick reference.\nAccess questions to help your child search his heart and read together verses from God’s Word, where God rebukes and where God offers encouragement for change.  \nFeatures:\nLinks to YouVersion or ESV Bible.\nAdd other applicable verses as you come across them.\nNote jotting capability.\n\nThis app is a wonderful way to follow the directive of Deuteronomy 6:5-7 as you are on the go.\n“Wise Words for Moms will help mothers – [and every father as well] to bend young twigs into strong and faithful trees.”\n- R. Albert Mohler, Jr., President, Southern Baptist Theological Seminary   [“Every father ought to borrow Mom’s copy as well.” is what Mohler actually said!]",
